# Throwaway emulator probe scripts. Several of these were committed by
# accident: they are written to the repository root, run once against the
# ROM to check a screen or a number, and then forgotten, and a `git add -A`
# sweeps them in. Nothing in the project has a root-level .mjs entry point,
# so ignoring the pattern costs nothing and stops it happening again.
/*.mjs
